{%- comment -%}
  The terms strip.

  This is where the sheet states its conditions, so it is written as a
  conditions row and not as three feature cards: no circles, no glyph icons,
  no shadow, no card. Every figure here must match the published policy pages
  exactly — the strip previously promised 7–14 days while the shipping policy
  said 8–17, on a store whose stated first principle is clarity before
  promises. The numbers are settings so a policy change can be made here
  without touching Liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="en-terms" dir="rtl" aria-label="תנאי הקנייה">
  <div class="en-terms__wrap">

    <div class="en-terms__row">
      <div class="en-terms__cell">
        <span class="en-terms__label">{{ section.settings.term_1_label | default: 'משלוח' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__value">{{ section.settings.term_1_value | default: 'חינם לנקודת איסוף' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__note">{{ section.settings.term_1_note | default: '29.90 ₪ עד הבית' }}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="en-terms__cell">
        <span class="en-terms__label">{{ section.settings.term_2_label | default: 'זמן אספקה' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__value">{{ section.settings.term_2_value | default: '8–17 ימי עסקים' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__note">{{ section.settings.term_2_note | default: '1–3 ימי טיפול ועוד 7–14 ימי משלוח · מוצרים עשויים להישלח ממחסנים מחוץ לישראל' }}</span>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The service cell has two truthful states. With a WhatsApp number set
        in theme settings it names the live channel; without one it stays on
        the email promise. It never claims a channel that does not exist.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign en_wa = settings.whatsapp_number | default: '' | strip | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' | remove: '+' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' -%}
      <div class="en-terms__cell">
        <span class="en-terms__label">{{ section.settings.term_3_label | default: 'לפני ההזמנה' }}</span>
        {%- if en_wa != blank -%}
          <span class="en-terms__value"><a class="en-terms__link" href="https://wa.me/{{ en_wa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ section.settings.term_3_value_wa | default: 'שאלו אותנו בוואטסאפ' }}</a></span>
          <span class="en-terms__note">{{ section.settings.term_3_note_wa | default: 'שלחו תמונה של המקום — נבדוק התאמה לפני שתזמינו' }}</span>
        {%- else -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            The fallback state promised "write to us" and gave no way to write:
            the whole strip carried exactly one link. A stated channel must be
            reachable from where it is stated, so the value carries the contact
            link here exactly as it carries the wa.me link above.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="en-terms__value"><a class="en-terms__link" href="/pages/contact-us">{{ section.settings.term_3_value | default: 'נבדוק התאמה למקום' }}</a></span>
          <span class="en-terms__note">{{ section.settings.term_3_note | default: 'שלחו תמונה של המקום וקישור למוצר — ואם לא מתאים, נגיד מראש' }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The cancellation cell states the statutory right only — 14 days from
        receipt under חוק הגנת הצרכן, exactly as the published refund policy
        words it. No אחריות claim appears anywhere on this strip.

        Israeli consumer law (distance selling) requires the site's HOME PAGE to
        carry a link through which a cancellation notice can actually be SENT —
        not a link to the policy that describes how. The policy link stays for
        the terms; the send link is what satisfies the requirement, so it is
        named for the act and not for the document.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="en-terms__cell">
        <span class="en-terms__label">{{ section.settings.term_4_label | default: 'ביטול עסקה' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__value">{{ section.settings.term_4_value | default: 'עד 14 ימים מקבלת המוצר' }}</span>
        <span class="en-terms__note">{{ section.settings.term_4_note | default: 'לפי חוק הגנת הצרכן · דמי ביטול עד 5% או 100 ₪, הנמוך מביניהם' }} · <a class="en-terms__note-link" href="{{ section.settings.term_4_cancel_url | default: '/pages/contact-us' }}">{{ section.settings.term_4_cancel_label | default: 'שליחת הודעת ביטול' }}</a> · <a class="en-terms__note-link" href="/policies/refund-policy">לתקנון המלא</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.en-terms,.en-terms *{box-sizing:border-box}
.en-terms{
  --terms-rule:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.16);
  direction:rtl;background:rgb(var(--en-surface-page));color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))
}
.en-terms__wrap{width:min(1200px,100%);margin-inline:auto;padding:0 clamp(18px,4vw,40px)}

/* One ruled band across the page. Rules, not boxes: a spec sheet separates
   fields with lines, and a card here would re-introduce the floating
   three-tile pattern this section was rewritten to remove. */
.en-terms__row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
  border-block:1px solid var(--terms-rule)
}
.en-terms__cell{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;
  padding:22px clamp(16px,2.4vw,28px);
  border-inline-start:1px solid var(--terms-rule)
}
.en-terms__cell:first-child{border-inline-start:0}

.en-terms__label{
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary));
  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.04em
}
.en-terms__value{
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary));
  font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;
  /* Written for figures, but these values read as Hebrew sentences
     ("חינם לנקודת איסוף"), so the tightening landed on the script that least
     tolerates it. Tabular figures stay; the tracking goes. */
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:normal
}
.en-terms__note{
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary));
  font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums
}
.en-terms__link{
  color:inherit!important;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;
  text-decoration-color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.4)
}
.en-terms__link:hover{text-decoration-color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))}
.en-terms__note-link{
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary))!important;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px
}
.en-terms__note-link:hover{color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important}
.en-terms a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid rgb(var(--en-text-primary));outline-offset:2px}

@media(max-width:1050px){
  .en-terms__row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .en-terms__cell:nth-child(odd){border-inline-start:0}
  .en-terms__cell:nth-child(n+3){border-block-start:1px solid var(--terms-rule)}
}
@media(max-width:640px){
  .en-terms__row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .en-terms__cell{border-inline-start:0;border-block-start:1px solid var(--terms-rule);padding:18px 0}
  .en-terms__cell:first-child{border-block-start:0}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ElmsNest terms strip",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "משלוח" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_1_label", "label": "כותרת", "default": "משלוח" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_1_value", "label": "ערך", "default": "חינם לנקודת איסוף" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_1_note", "label": "הערה", "default": "29.90 ₪ עד הבית" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "זמן אספקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_2_label", "label": "כותרת", "default": "זמן אספקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_2_value", "label": "ערך", "default": "8–17 ימי עסקים" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_2_note", "label": "הערה", "default": "1–3 ימי טיפול ועוד 7–14 ימי משלוח" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "לפני ההזמנה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_3_label", "label": "כותרת", "default": "לפני ההזמנה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_3_value", "label": "ערך (בלי וואטסאפ)", "default": "נבדוק התאמה למקום" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_3_note", "label": "הערה (בלי וואטסאפ)", "default": "כתבו לנו ונחזור אליכם" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_3_value_wa", "label": "ערך (עם וואטסאפ)", "default": "שאלו אותנו בוואטסאפ", "info": "מוצג רק כשמספר וואטסאפ מוגדר בהגדרות הערכה (ElmsNest)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_3_note_wa", "label": "הערה (עם וואטסאפ)", "default": "שלחו תמונה של המקום — נבדוק התאמה לפני שתזמינו" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "ביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_4_label", "label": "כותרת", "default": "ביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_4_value", "label": "ערך", "default": "עד 14 ימים מקבלת המוצר" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_4_note", "label": "הערה", "default": "לפי חוק הגנת הצרכן" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "term_4_cancel_label", "label": "טקסט קישור שליחת ביטול", "default": "שליחת הודעת ביטול", "info": "חובה חוקית: בדף הבית חייב להופיע קישור שדרכו ניתן לשלוח הודעת ביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "term_4_cancel_url", "label": "יעד קישור שליחת ביטול", "info": "ברירת מחדל: /pages/contact-us" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "ElmsNest terms strip" }]
}
{% endschema %}
